OL,3,GNEWSALeaders welcome plan for elected
OL,4,Amayor for Kent
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent could be on course to have an
OL,7,Felected mayor in the biggest shake-up
OL,8,Fof local government in more than half a
OL,9,Fcentury.
OL,11,FA statement released immediately after
OL,12,Fthe government delivered the Budget
OL,13,Fdetailed 10 devolution agreements for
OL,14,Fmayoral strategic authorities across
OL,15,Fthe country, said the Local Democracy
OL,16,FReporting Service.
OL,18,FMedway Council leader Vince Maple
OL,19,Fwelcomed the announcement "of a new
OL,20,Fstrategic authority for Kent and Medway
OL,21,Fwhich I am hopeful will include a new
OL,22,FMayor for our region".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
