OL,3,GNEWSALeaders welcome plan for elected
OL,4,Amayor for Kent
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Mayors can deliver so much for local
OL,7,Fpeople: Transport, regeneration and
OL,8,Fcommunities that work for everyone in
OL,9,Fthe region," he said.
